<title>USA: ImageMatrix names Hefter president/COO.</title>
<headline>ImageMatrix names Hefter president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImageMatrix Corp said Thursday that it has promoted Dennis Hefter to president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Hefter was formerly the executive vice president, responsible for sales and marketing management, the company said.</p>
<p>Gerald Henderson continues to be chairman and chief executive officer of ImageMatrix, it said. He also held the position of president before Hefter's appointment.</p>
<p>David Proestos has been hired as vice president of sales to replace Hefter in that function, it said. Proestos was most recently district manager of the Rocky Mountain sales region of FileNet Corp, it said.</p>
